{% slide title="What is mobility?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_2_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_2_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Mobility means moving from one place to another.
You can walk, or use a wheelchair.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_2_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_2_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
You can take a bus or a train.
You can also drive a car.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_2_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_2_Freeform_9.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Mobility is part of everyday life.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Reminder: Two types of AI" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_3_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_3_Freeform_6.png)
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Two types of AI" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
**AI assistants** explain things to you in simple language.
You can talk to AI assistants.
You can ask questions to AI assistants.
ChatGPT is an AI assistant.

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_4_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_4_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_4_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_4_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Two types of AI" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
**AI tools** are computer programs companies use.
Some apps use AI tools to understand the world.
Map apps use AI tools to help you navigate.
AI tools help companies predict future problems.

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_5_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_5_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_5_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_5_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Why AI can help everyone travel better" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_6_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_6_Freeform_6.png)
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Why do you need help when you drive?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_7_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_7_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Anna wants to **drive** across the city.
There are **many roads** she could take.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_7_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_7_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Anna does not know **which road is best** today.
Some roads have too many cars right now.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Why do you need help when you drive?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_8_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_8_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A map app can **check the roads** instead of Anna.
AI tools look at the traffic on every road.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_8_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_8_Freeform_9.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
AI tools find the **fastest road** for her.
A map app shows her the road on a map.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="How many things affect traffic" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_9_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_9_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A city has thousands of roads.
Roads have traffic problems every day.
One person cannot check every road alone.
AI tools can check the whole city instead.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="To measure traffic, AI tools check different data" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_10_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_10_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
- How many cars use a road
- Where trips start and end
- Where parking is hard to find
- When drivers brake very fast
- How much fuel a route uses
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="How map apps with AI tools help us" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
A **red road** has many cars right now.
A **green road** has only a few cars.

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_11_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_11_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
The map app on your phone shows the **roads**.
Some roads have a red colour on the map.

AI tools check the cars on every road in the city.
Map apps put the colours on the map for you.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="AI assistants can answer questions" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_12_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_12_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
You can ask questions to AI assistants.
Questions to AI assistants are called **prompts**.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_12_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_12_Freeform_9.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
AI assistants can find information about places.
AI assistants can help you find accessible transport.
AI assistants can only know recent information if you send it to them.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="How can we improve our mobility?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_13_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_13_Freeform_6.png)
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Airport help" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_14_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_14_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A good prompt has a **need**.
A good prompt has a **place**.
"How do I book wheelchair help at Bologna airport?"
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Visiting a historical monument" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_15_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_15_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A good prompt has a **need**.
A good prompt has a **place**.
"Can I visit the Colosseum in a wheelchair?"
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Accessible bus" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_16_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_16_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
When you ask for directions, say the starting point and end point.
"Is there a wheelchair-accessible bus from
the Rome station to the Colosseum?"
This is a good prompt for directions.
This prompt says your **need** to use a wheelchair.
The **place** has two parts: start and end.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Museum for blind visitors" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_17_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_17_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
"Are there museums with touch exhibits for blind visitors in Bologna?"
This is a good prompt for mobility.
Sometimes we do not know the exact **place**.
We only know the **need** (blind-accessible).
This question names the type of help needed.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Read the bus timetable with a photo" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_18_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_18_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
The bus stop has a sign with the timetable.
The timetable has many small numbers.
You take a photo of the timetable with your phone.
You send the photo to an AI assistant.
You can ask your question to the AI assistant.
"This is the timetable of bus 23. When does the next bus leave after 5 o'clock from station?"
For this prompt, we need a **place**, but also a **time.**
Check the answer on the timetable too.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Good prompts for mobility" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_19_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_19_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A good question has the **need,** **place** and the **time**.
Next, you will try asking your own questions.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="My personal data on AI" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_20_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_20_Freeform_6.png)
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Safe to share?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_21_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_21_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Your home address tells strangers where you live.
A big place near your home works the same.
The AI assistant still finds a good route for you.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="What is private information?" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_22_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_22_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
Private information belongs to you and your family.
For example, your home address is private information.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Real stories: AI helps save time and fuel" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_23_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_23_Freeform_6.png)
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Real apps that use AI tools to help disabled travellers" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_24_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_24_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
- Some apps help blind people travel.
- The app "BeMyEyes" uses volunteers or AI tools to describe photos.
- A blind person can take a photo.
- An AI tool describes what is in the photo.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="Real apps that use AI tools to help disabled travellers" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_25_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_25_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
- Google Maps also helps disabled travellers.
- Google Maps can show wheelchair-accessible places.
- Google Maps can also show step-free routes.
- A step-free route has no stairs.
- Note: check if it is available in your city!
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="The delivery company (UPS) 1/2" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_26_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_26_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
A delivery company sends **trucks** every day.
Trucks used to **turn left** very often.
A left turn crosses other cars' path.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_26_Freeform_8.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_26_Freeform_8.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
This means waiting a long time to turn.
The company built a **computer program**.
This program plans the best route for each truck.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_26_Freeform_9.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_26_Freeform_9.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
The program chooses more **right turns**.
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% slide title="The delivery company (UPS) 2/2" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
This saves a lot of driving time and fuel
This is one real way computer programs help mobility.

{% columns %}
{% column %}
![slide_27_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_27_Freeform_7.png)
{% /column %}
{% column %}
![slide_27_Freeform_6.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-2/slide_27_Freeform_6.png)
{% /column %}
{% /columns %}
{% /slide %}

{% /slideshow %}